<h1 data-copy-en="Magistra Ruxandra" data-copy-zh="Magistra Ruxandra">Magistra Ruxandra</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Reach the laboratory and follow research visits and Blood Alchemy." data-copy-zh="抵达实验室，推进研究会面并使用血液炼金术。">Reach the laboratory and follow research visits and Blood Alchemy.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Obtain_and_Use_Blood_Orbs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Two_repeatable_upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Six_permanent_key_items"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Blood_Alchemy_Shop"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Causal_Window_with_Torea"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Six_Vampire-Stat_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Talk_and_Introduction"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Suggested_Progression"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Reach_the_Vampire_Laboratory"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Magistra Ruxandra — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ruxandra.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Magistra Ruxandra — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ruxandra.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Magistra Ruxandra — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Magistra Ruxandra’s laboratory combines a six-part personal research sequence with Blood Alchemy. The conversations use your Vampire stat; the shop has its own separate gate.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>She is at Vampire Laboratory all day. One route is the Castle tile on normal Dungeon floor 23. The other opens after Story 61 through the Uptown city library, basement and dark corridor. The laboratory travel inside the lair takes 0 minutes.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Visit for Magistra Ruxandra, then return as effective Vampire reaches 10, 20, 30, 40, 50 and 60. Each research visit requires the previous one; equipment and other applicable Vampire modifiers count. Raising Ruxandra affection cannot replace the Vampire requirement.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Magistra Ruxandra</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Vampire Laboratory</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Blood As Data</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Vampire Laboratory</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Magistra Ruxandra; Vampire 10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Obedient Prison</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Vampire Laboratory</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Magistra Ruxandra / Blood As Data; Vampire 20</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Negotiating Body</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Vampire Laboratory</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Magistra Ruxandra / The Obedient Prison; Vampire 30</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sunlight Is An Insult</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Vampire Laboratory</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Magistra Ruxandra / The Negotiating Body; Vampire 40</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Vanishing Problem</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Vampire Laboratory</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Magistra Ruxandra / Sunlight Is An Insult; Vampire 50</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Second Nutrient</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Vampire Laboratory</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Magistra Ruxandra / The Vanishing Problem; Vampire 60</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Causal Window</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Vampire Laboratory</td><td data-label="Requirements">Torea Acquaintance (50); after Magistra Ruxandra</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The Causal Window is separate: finish Ruxandra’s introduction and reach Acquaintance (50) with Torea, then visit the laboratory. It does not require finishing all six research visits.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Ruxandra</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Blood Alchemy is a laboratory location action, available at effective Vampire 25. It spends unconsumed Blood Orb items rather than money or Crystals; opening the shop and purchasing take 0 minutes. No relationship stage or Vampirism skill is required to open it. The linked shop guide has every price and effect.</p><p>Favorite stats are Vampire, Mystic, Intelligence. The learned Alchemy skill improves her relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Completion_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Use normal Dungeon floor 23, not an Infinity-floor shortcut.</li><li>The library shortcut needs Story 61 and the library’s actual opening/access conditions.</li><li>For a research visit check effective Vampire and the previous visit, not affection alone.</li><li>A consumed Blood Orb cannot also pay for a shop purchase.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-ruxandra-s-alchemy-shop.html">Blood Alchemy prices and effects</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">Dungeon access</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story progression</a></li><li><a href="character-torea.html">Torea</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Obtain_and_Use_Blood_Orbs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Two_repeatable_upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Six_permanent_key_items"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Blood_Alchemy_Shop"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Causal_Window_with_Torea"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Six_Vampire-Stat_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Talk_and_Introduction"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Suggested_Progression"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Reach_the_Vampire_Laboratory"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Magistra Ruxandra 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ruxandra.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Magistra Ruxandra 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ruxandra.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Magistra Ruxandra 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Magistra Ruxandra的实验室有六段个人研究事件，也提供血液炼金术。研究看玩家的吸血鬼属性，商店则有自己的独立门槛。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>她全天在吸血鬼实验室。可从普通地下城第23层的城堡格进入；主线61后也可经上城区城市图书馆、地下室与黑暗走廊抵达。进入巢穴后的实验室交通不消耗时间。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先进行Ruxandra 女导师，再随有效吸血鬼属性达到10、20、30、40、50、60依次到访。每段都要求上一段完成，装备等适用修正会计入吸血鬼属性；提高Ruxandra好感不能代替属性门槛。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Ruxandra 女导师</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">吸血鬼实验室</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">血即数据</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">吸血鬼实验室</td><td data-label="条件">完成：Ruxandra 女导师；吸血鬼10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">顺从的囚笼</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">吸血鬼实验室</td><td data-label="条件">完成：Ruxandra 女导师、血即数据；吸血鬼20</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">会谈判的身体</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">吸血鬼实验室</td><td data-label="条件">完成：Ruxandra 女导师、顺从的囚笼；吸血鬼30</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">阳光是一种侮辱</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">吸血鬼实验室</td><td data-label="条件">完成：Ruxandra 女导师、会谈判的身体；吸血鬼40</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">消失问题</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">吸血鬼实验室</td><td data-label="条件">完成：Ruxandra 女导师、阳光是一种侮辱；吸血鬼50</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第二种养分</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">吸血鬼实验室</td><td data-label="条件">完成：Ruxandra 女导师、消失问题；吸血鬼60</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">因果之窗</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">吸血鬼实验室</td><td data-label="条件">Torea 相识（50）；完成：Ruxandra 女导师</td></tr></tbody></table><p>因果之窗是独立事件，只要求Ruxandra初次事件完成、Torea达到相识（50），再到实验室，不必先完成全部六段研究。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Ruxandra 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>血液炼金术位于实验室地点行动中，要求有效吸血鬼25，以尚未消耗的鲜血宝珠支付，不收金钱或水晶。打开商店与购买都不消耗时间，也不要求特定关系阶段或先学吸血鬼化；完整价格与效果见专门指南。</p><p>偏好的属性为吸血鬼、神秘、智力。学会炼金术可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Completion_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>入口是普通地下城第23层，不是无限地下城的楼层捷径。</li><li>图书馆捷径需要主线61，并满足图书馆实际开放条件。</li><li>研究事件检查有效吸血鬼和前一段完成状态，只有好感不够。</li><li>已经使用的鲜血宝珠不能再次支付商店费用。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-ruxandra-s-alchemy-shop.html">血液炼金术价格与效果</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">地下城入口</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">主线进度</a></li><li><a href="character-torea.html">Torea</a></li></ul></section>
